   <!-- Shipping &amp; Insurance -->
   <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
         <h2 class="card-title mb-0">Shipping &amp; Insurance</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
         <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xl-6 order-xl-last p-0">
               <div class="alert alert-success">
                  <b>Using Our Courier Quotes</b>
                  <p>We currently use various couriers for shipping. Depending on the country, different couriers will offer better rates. Please choose from;</p>
                  <p>Lowest Freight Cost: this offers no tracking number, and normally the longest transit time, but with the lowest freight cost.</p>
                  <p>Lowest Freight Costs with tracking: you are able to track the status online for this shipment and receive exact delivery dates.</p>
                  <b>Using My Freight Account</b>
                  <p>If you have your own courier (Fedex, DHL, etc.) please enter your details including the account number. Please make sure you have an international account. When using your account you can also choose to accept courier's insurance.</p>
                  <b>Shipping Instructions</b>
                  <p>These instructions will always be a default setting for all your orders. Some examples include;</p>
                  <ul>
                     <li>"always choose International Economy" service on our Fedex Account</li>
                     <li>do not send invoice with goods</li>
                     <li>delivery after 10am</li>
                  </ul>
                  <div class="require_own_freight_n" {{ (model.own_freight == 'n') ? 'style="opacity: 0.00346577;"' : 'style="display:none;opacity: 0.00346577;"' }}>
                     <b>Insurance</b>
                     <p>Insurance is available for all shipments with tracking, and covers goods in transit. For example, you have purchased parts value of $5,000usd plus $500usd courier costs, and the cargo has been lost. If you have chosen insurance, we will cover the full loss of $5,500usd.</p>
                     <p>Please note that if you do not choose insurance, any loss is fully sustained by you. Generally the courier companies offers limited liability with most up to a value of $100usd or the cost of transport only.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xl-6">
               <div class="form-group form-row field-register_own_freight_n">
                  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-11">
                     <div class="form-check">
                        <input type="radio" id="register_own_freight_n" class="form-check-input" name="own_freight" value="n" {{(model.own_freight=='n')?'checked':''}}><label class="form-check-label" for="register_own_freight_n">Use our online freight quote when purchasing</label> 
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="form-group form-row field-register_own_freight_y">
                  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-11">
                     <div class="form-check">
                        <input type="radio" id="register_own_freight_y" class="form-check-input" name="own_freight" value="y" {{(model.own_freight=='y')? 'checked':''}}><label class="form-check-label" for="register_own_freight_y"   >Use my own freight account</label> 
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="require_own_freight_n" {{ (model.own_freight == 'n') ? '' : 'style="display:none;"' }}>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-freight_priority">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="freight_priority">Shipping Priority</label><span class="text-danger">*</span></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <select id="freight_priority" class="form-control" name="freight_priority" required="required">
                           <option value="cheapest" {{(model.freight_priority=='cheapest')?'selected':''}}>Lowest Freight Cost</option>
                           <option value="tracking" {{(model.freight_priority=='tracking')?'selected':''}}>Lowest Freight Cost with Tracking</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               
               <div class="require_own_freight_y" {{ model.own_freight == 'y' ? '' : 'style="display:none;"' }}>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-courier">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="courier">Courier</label><span class="text-danger">*</span></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <select id="courier" class="form-control" name="courier">
                           <option value=""></option>
                           {% for keycou,courier_data in courier_list %}
                            <option value="{{keycou}}" {{(model.courier==keycou)?'selected':''}}>{{courier_data}}</option>
                            {% endfor %}
                            <option value="0">Other</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-courier_name" style="display:none;">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="courier_name">Courier Name</label><span class="text-danger">*</span></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <input type="text" id="courier_name" class="form-control" name="courier_name" value="{{model.courier_name}}">  
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-account_number">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="account_number">Account Number</label></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <input type="text" id="account_number" class="form-control" name="account_number" value="{{model.account_number}}">  
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-ship_insurance">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="ship_insurance">Ship Insurance</label></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <select id="ship_insurance" class="form-control" name="ship_insurance">
                           <option value="n" {{(model.ship_insurance=='n')?'selected':''}}>No</option>
                           <option value="y" {{(model.ship_insurance=='y')?'selected':''}}>Yes</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="form-group form-row field-s_instructions">
                  <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="s_instructions">Shipping Instructions</label></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                     <textarea id="s_instructions" class="form-control" name="s_instructions" rows="8">{{model.s_instructions}}</textarea>
                     <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="require_own_freight_n" {{ model.own_freight == 'n' ? '' : 'style="display:none;"' }}>
                  <div class="form-group form-row field-insurance_required">
                     <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="insurance_required">Insurance</label><span class="text-danger">*</span></div>
                     <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                        <select id="insurance_required" class="form-control" name="insurance_required" required="required">
                           <option value="y" {{(model.insurance_required=='y')?'selected':''}}>Yes - I want my shipment insured</option>
                           <option value="n" {{(model.insurance_required=='n')?'selected':''}}>No - I do not need insurance</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   <!-- Your Preferences -->
   <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
         <h2 class="card-title mb-0">Your Preferences</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
         <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xl-6 order-xl-last p-0">
               <div class="alert alert-success">
                  <p>
<b>Default Currency</b><br>
Arcooda only issues invoices in USD or AUD (with GST tax), however, we can offer approximate costs in your currency (please mouse over the ($) icon near the sell price to view the approximate price in your currency). </p>
                  <b>Mailing List</b>
                  <p>Join our newsletter for the latest product information, specials and clearance sales. You can turn on/off to receive the newsletter in your "My Account".</p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xl-6">
               <div class="form-group form-row field-b_transactioncurrency">
                  <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="b_transactioncurrency">Default Currency</label></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                     <select id="b_transactioncurrency" class="form-control" name="b_transactionCurrency" autocomplete="section-register billing transaction-currency">
                         {% for  currency in currency_list %}
                           <option value="{{ currency.code }}"{{ ('USD' == currency.code) ? ' selected="selected"' : '' }}>{{ currency.code }} - {{ currency.name|e }}</option>
                        {% endfor %}
                     </select>
                     <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="form-group form-row field-mailing_list">
                  <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="mailing_list">Join Mailing List</label></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8">
                     <select id="mailing_list" class="form-control" name="mailing_list">
                        <option value="y" {{(model.mailing_list=='y')?'selected':''}}>Yes</option>
                        <option value="n" {{(model.mailing_list=='n')?'selected':''}}>No</option>
                     </select>
                     <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="form-group form-row field-mailing_list">
                  <div class="col-sm-5 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-5 col-xxl-4 col-form-label"><label for="mailing_list">Captcha</label></div>
                  <div class="col-sm-7 col-md-8 col-lg-9 col-xl-7 col-xxl-8" style="display:flex;">
                     <img src="/captchaimage?v={{ date().timestamp }}" style="height: 36px;">
                     <input type="text"  required class="form-control" name="captcha" style="width:50%;margin-left: 5px;" placeholder="Total">  
                     <div class="invalid-feedback "></div>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   {% if issues.action %}<div class="alert alert-danger">{{ issues.action }}</div>{% endif %}
   <input type="hidden" name="action" value="register" />
   <div class="text-center">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-3" id="registerBtn" >Register</button>
   </div>
</div>
